<LegalPage
  title="Man of the Match: Voting Rules"
  tag="Man of the Match"
  description="How fan voting for the Lobi Stars FC Man of the Match works: who can vote, when voting opens and closes, and how the winner is chosen."
  updated="8 November 2026"
>
  <h2>How it works</h2>
  <ol>
    <li><strong>Create a fan account.</strong> It is free. Confirm your email address so your vote counts.</li>
    <li><strong>Vote from 4:00 pm.</strong> Voting opens automatically at kick-off. Open the game from Fixtures or the Man of the Match page and choose the Vote tab in Matchday Live.</li>
    <li><strong>Pick your player.</strong> Choose one Lobi Stars player who is playing in the match — the starting XI or a substitute who has come on. One vote per fan per match.</li>
    <li><strong>See the winner at 5:50 pm.</strong> Voting closes automatically at 5:50 pm and the Man of the Match is announced on the Man of the Match page before the final whistle, with the top 3 players' votes and percentages.</li>
  </ol>

  <h2>Good to know</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Voting is for Lobi Stars home games only.</li>
    <li>Voting opens at 4:00 pm and closes at 5:50 pm.</li>
    <li>You can vote for players in the starting XI and substitutes who come on during the match. Unused substitutes cannot be voted for.</li>
    <li>One vote per verified fan account per match.</li>
    <li>The winner is announced automatically at 5:50 pm, together with how the top 3 players were voted.</li>
    <li>If players are level on votes, the player who reached that total first wins.</li>
    <li>All voting times use the official club clock (Nigerian time).</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Details</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Voting opens at kick-off and closes 1 hour 50 minutes later (4:00 pm to 5:50 pm for a 4:00 pm kick-off). If kick-off is moved, both times move with it. Postponed or abandoned matches have no vote.</li>
    <li>A substitute can be voted for from the moment his substitution is recorded.</li>
    <li><strong>One vote per account per match.</strong> Votes cannot be changed.</li>
    <li>Votes from accounts created less than 24 hours before kick-off are saved but not counted.</li>
    <li>While voting is open, vote totals are not shown.</li>
    <li>Each player's total of Man of the Match awards is shown on their profile. The Lobi Stars Man of the Match award is proudly sponsored by Mr. Moses Orkuma.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Fair play</h2>
  <p>The club may remove votes it reasonably believes come from fake or duplicate accounts. The club's decision is final. Your personal data is used as described in our <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
